@host = http://localhost:5249

### Health
GET {{host}}/

### List all tasks
GET {{host}}/api/todos

### Create a task (quick-add / new-task dialog)
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Buy milk", "due": "2026-07-20", "amount": -3.50, "dateKind": "due", "catIds": ["he"] }

### Update a task (edit dialog; preserves done)
PUT {{host}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Finish Q3 revenue report", "due": "2026-07-18", "amount": null, "dateKind": "due", "catIds": ["wr"] }

### Toggle done
PATCH {{host}}/api/todos/1/toggle

### Delete a task
DELETE {{host}}/api/todos/1

### Category tree (mains + subs + counts)
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Add a main category
POST {{host}}/api/mains
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Side project" }

### Add a sub category
POST {{host}}/api/subs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mainId": "work", "name": "Standups" }

### Delete a main (cascades to its subs, strips them from tasks + title defaults)
DELETE {{host}}/api/mains/home

### Title defaults
GET {{host}}/api/title-defaults

### Remember categories for a title
PUT {{host}}/api/title-defaults/whole foods market
Content-Type: application/json

{ "catIds": ["he"] }

### Parse a pasted bank statement
POST {{host}}/api/import/parse
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "2026-07-15\tACME CORP PAYROLL\t+4200.00\n2026-07-14\tWHOLE FOODS MARKET\t-76.20" }

### Commit parsed rows as transaction tasks
POST {{host}}/api/import/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rows": [ { "title": "ACME CORP PAYROLL", "date": "2026-07-15", "amount": 4200.00, "catIds": ["pf"] } ] }

### Spending report (omit `categories` for all; empty for none)
GET {{host}}/api/report?from=2026-07-01&to=2026-07-31

### Spending report, only Finance
GET {{host}}/api/report?from=2026-07-01&to=2026-07-31&categories=pf
